Package: lavHelper
Title: Helper Functions for lavaan Models
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Helper functions for 'lavaan' models.
    The functions convert between 'lavaan' model matrices
    and reticular action model (RAM) matrices,
    compute the standardized solution from RAM matrices,
    and extract the parameter estimates of a fitted model
    including fixed parameters, defined parameters,
    and equality and inequality constraints.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/lavHelper,
        https://ijapesigan.github.io/lavHelper/
